{"id":"xfs_admin.8","lang":"en","desc":"Tune an XFS filesystem.","items":[["Display the filesystem label","sudo xfs_admin {{[-l|--list]}} {{/dev/sdX}}"],["Set the filesystem label","sudo xfs_admin {{[-L|--Label]}} \"{{label}}\" {{/dev/sdX}}"],["Display the filesystem UUID","sudo xfs_admin {{[-u|--uuid]}} {{/dev/sdX}}"],["Set the filesystem UUID (use with caution)","sudo xfs_admin {{[-U|--UUID]}} {{uuid}} {{/dev/sdX}}"],["Generate a new UUID for the filesystem","sudo xfs_admin {{[-U|--UUID]}} generate {{/dev/sdX}}"],["Display help","xfs_admin"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/linux/xfs_admin.md"}